  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 308.12 Registration Filing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 308.12 Registration Filing.\n\n(a) General permit registrations completed in accordance with Env-Sw 308.11 shall be filed in accordance with Env-Sw 303.\n\n(b) All registrations filed for a general permit shall be signed by the registrant and the property owner, if other than the registrant, in accordance with Env-Sw 303.04.\n\n(c) The registrant shall complete and file a registration in accordance with Env-Sw 308.10 within 10 days of any change in the information provided in a previously filed registration.\n\nSource. #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw300.html"
